{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed","id":832443,"title":"Mask/Mein in 2nd Ed","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-18T04:52:14-08:00","id":832443,"title":"Mask/Mein in 2nd Ed","content":"Is it just me, or will it be confusing to use the terms Mask and Mein in two different forms in the same gameline?<br /> <br /> In the playtest stuff that was just put out, it points out that Mask and Mein are the new Changeling specific Virtue/Vice analogs, used to basically represent &quot;the you everyone sees&quot; and &quot;the you only you see&quot; respectively (which in of itself is very similar to Vampire's Mask and Dirge, but that's another topic). Should there be a different term for these? Fact and Fable maybe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2283-andreamus","name":"andreamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2283_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T04:55:56-08:00","id":832446,"title":"","content":"Persona and Shadow would be my preference. Though I have to say it'd be abit funny having Fact and Fable, where fable ended up being your more human side since your Fact is your true changeling side.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 02-18-2016, 09:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T06:43:33-08:00","id":832480,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>andreamus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed#post832443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it just me, or will it be confusing to use the terms Mask and Mein in two different forms in the same gameline?</div> </div> </div> </div>You're not the only one. Especially with dropping the Mask taking on such a useful role in the new edition, having one of their Anchors also being called Mask could get quite confusing. It drives me nuts whenever a game uses the same term for different things, like Scion making it possible to drop your (human) Avatar so that you could take on your Avatar (of a Purview) to fight against an Avatar (of a Titan). I would love to see different terms for them, though, even if I have few ideas for what they could be. Cover and Contents? Tale and Truth? Story and Soul? Hell, even something like Beast's Life and Legend could work well. I'd also like to second what others have said, and say that I'd like to see some more fairytale archetypes included, rather than them seeming mostly like the Nature and Demeanor ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T09:32:17-08:00","id":832556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed?p=832446#post832446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Persona and Shadow would be my preference.</div> </div> </div> </div>Very Jungian. I like it. (Even if it is very strongly reminiscent of the Persona series as well)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T11:22:30-08:00","id":832621,"title":"","content":"How about Face and Fa\u00e7ade? Keeps the alliteration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T12:51:02-08:00","id":832688,"title":"","content":"<b>I would go with Truth and Tale, as <i>Tale</i> would be the sum up of yours life in Arcadia ( with change from Seeming ) and <i>Truth</i> would be this part that reconnects you to humanity and lead you back on Earth.</b> Unmasked, in only their Mein, changelings would be more responsible to go with the <i>Tale</i> archetype, reconnecting with their Durance history and &quot;feyism&quot;. But in humans society, reclaiming their life - they would go with the <i>Truth</i> that made them return, what they really are, deep down.<br /> <br /> Also, they would nicely reflect Virtue and Vices of mortals - <b>Truth</b> would be Virtue-base Anchor and <b>Tale</b> ( as leading in to plays of Others and many Arcadian dangers ) would naturally play the role of Vice replacement.<br /> <br /> And you ask &quot;<b>Why do we need pointing some neboulus connections to Virtue and Vice with changelings Willpower Anchors?&quot; </b><br /> <br /> Answer is fivefold:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li><i>Dreamwalking</i> is connected to psychic of victim, reflecting filtered Astral for her in sleep ( sort of ). Virtue and Vice are important motives of dreams, but run with different contexts. Vices are trying to &quot;buy you&quot;, to get you easier way. And Virtues are the hardships character goes for in her dreams. This leads that knowing &quot;which is which&quot; for changelings can lend us simple frame to running dream sequances for Lost.</li> <li>Social Maneuvering system in whole <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> get's character extra Doors for fighting against it's Virtue. And this mechanics is all over the 2ED games rules. So some Virtue replacement would solve this compatibility problem.</li> <li>In <b>Werewolf</b> 2ED and <b>Beast</b> we have clear indications for what of two Anchors works as more or less as Virtue and what as Vice ( <i>Bone</i> and <i>Life</i> as first, <i>Blood</i> and <i>Legend</i> as second ). This trend would be good if maintained.</li> <li>There are some powers and environments that change archetypes mechanics ( Vices works as Virtues, Virtues works as Vices ), like , for example, rules in Underworld. It lead to confusion what I need to make with archetypes like Mask &amp; Mien from playtests rules.</li> <li>As <b>Mage</b> ST with a knack for Astral journeys, it is important for me to decide what is Vice-equivalent for the character as for goetic demons. I must need to know what is most important &quot;sin&quot; of the character to build proper demon for them. With Mask &amp; Mien as they are - I cannot choose which is what.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-18-2016, 04:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T14:34:43-08:00","id":832761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed?p=832688#post832688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>I would go with Truth and Tale, as <i>Tale</i> would be the sum up of yours life in Arcadia ( with change from Seeming ) and <i>Truth</i> would be this part that reconnects you to humanity and lead you back on Earth.</b> Unmasked, in only their Mein, changelings would be more responsible to go with the <i>Tale</i> archetype, reconnecting with their Durance history and &quot;feyism&quot;. But in humans society, reclaiming their life - they would go with the <i>Truth</i> that made them return, what they really are, deep down.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't really see why they should change it so &quot;the human side is the truth&quot; and &quot;the changeling side is the lie&quot;. Since changelings are going to spend most of their time in human society living a lie that they are human anymore.... it seems opposite to the games themes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Very Jungian. I like it. (Even if it is very strongly reminiscent of the Persona series as well)</span> </div> </div> </div><br /> Jungian was my intent, though I am a fan of persona. It also helps that persona also literally meant mask, so swapping it for mask would be pretty easy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 02-18-2016, 05:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T14:36:47-08:00","id":832762,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't believe in faeries&quot; keeps the Gentry away?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T16:31:21-08:00","id":832820,"title":"","content":"I'm certainly going to lend my support to clearer lexicon.<br /> <br /> Using mask/mein as both in-game concepts and anchors is definitely confusing. Keeping the anchors as Vice/Virtue would even be preferred (even if it was like Demon in that sense where you're expected to make them unusual).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T16:57:26-08:00","id":832842,"title":"","content":"The problem with Mask and Mien is that they both mean the same. They're both synonyms for demeanour. While that makes perfect sense for the difference between a changeling's true looks and her glamoured visage, it feels a bit flat when it comes to distinguish between how she acts and how she really is.<br /> <br /> I throw in my support for Truth and Tale. With Changelings being natural deceivers, paranoid and evasive, I feel like &quot;Truth&quot; would be a narratively interesting choice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T17:19:00-08:00","id":832853,"title":"","content":"I'll probably consider a name shift. <br /> <br /> Fun fact, here was the original pitch I was going with back before first drafts. This is a direct quote from the email where it was pitched: <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">&quot;The </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Needle</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> (What stuck you) and The </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Thread</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> (What Pulled You Loose)? Needles can be anything from corkboard pins, the prick that put Sleeping Beauty to sleep, or the hook in the cheek, thematically. And the </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Thread</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">? Led the hero of the labyrinth. The ties that bind. The red string of fate\u2026or just some unfinished business. How\u2019s THAT for some symbology?&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T17:21:07-08:00","id":832855,"title":"","content":"I like Needle and Thread, it fit the fairy tale theme rather well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T17:47:55-08:00","id":832881,"title":"","content":"Truth and Tale are similar to one of the things I originally mulled over for the names. I agree that in practice they're just going to lead to confusion. I do like &quot;Shadow&quot; because of the symbolism that changelings and fetches have with shadows. &quot;Persona&quot; I could go either way on; I like it as a term, but I don't know if it really hits what I'm going for. However, at the moment, I'm not completely sure what I would use in its place.<br /> <br /> The similarities between Masque/Dirge and Blood/Bone are not unintentional. I wanted to keep the changeling equivalents as something that operated on similar grounds, but evoked a bit more of the &quot;actors in the grandest play&quot; vibe. Needle and Thread also work pretty well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T18:58:32-08:00","id":832941,"title":"","content":"I would be tickled pink if we could justify Illusion and Dream as the Anchors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T08:58:21-08:00","id":833864,"title":"","content":"So in the character creation rules just drop &quot;virtue and vice&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T10:44:59-08:00","id":833915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gnomish American</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed?p=833864#post833864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So in the character creation rules just drop &amp;quot;virtue and vice&amp;quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mask and Mein replace Virtue and Vice, yeah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T11:44:51-08:00","id":833944,"title":"","content":"Danke, Char.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T13:37:06-08:00","id":834007,"title":"","content":"Have naming convention problem - I want to make Masque ( Virtue-based Anchor ) for my playtest character on the original &quot;Pragmatism&quot; Virtue, but would want to call it more fairy tale like. Maybe something like &quot;Sage&quot;?<br /> <br /> I changed previewed &quot;Romantic&quot; in to &quot;Lover&quot; for the Mien of character. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T13:40:07-08:00","id":834010,"title":"","content":"&quot;Prudence&quot; is the most fairy-tale sounding synonym for pragmatism I can think of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T13:42:34-08:00","id":834012,"title":"","content":"But we should strife to the &quot;role&quot; name for Changeling Anchors - like &quot;Fool&quot;. &quot;Lover&quot;, &quot;Hag&quot;, &quot;Knight&quot;, etc.<br /> <br /> How to based &quot;role&quot; on the Prudance? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T13:45:43-08:00","id":834015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed?p=834012#post834012\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But we should strife to the &quot;role&quot; name for Changeling Anchors - like &quot;Fool&quot;. &quot;Lover&quot;, &quot;Hag&quot;, &quot;Knight&quot;, etc.<br /> <br /> How to based &quot;role&quot; on the Prudance? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not all roles are a role. Romantic and Idealist are examples where they're an adjective rather than a noun. &quot;Prudent&quot; might be a suitable Thread/Needle/Mask/Mien if they have an appropriate 1WP/AllWP mechanic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T13:49:55-08:00","id":834019,"title":"","content":"I was the one of users that was displeased with using adjectives as Anchors, as they sound to much like <b>Vampire</b> ones. Guys, we need the more &quot;fairy-tale&quot; like references, not less.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T14:44:45-08:00","id":834064,"title":"","content":"Maybe I should go with Mask as &quot;Entrepreneur&quot;? It does sound role that could be in some modern fairy tale...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T08:21:15-07:00","id":996604,"title":"","content":"I am just so confused. What is this Anchor business? And is the Needle equivalent to Virtue or Vice?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T09:29:20-07:00","id":996644,"title":"","content":"Anchor is the general system term for a set of traits relating to the Integrity analogue and Willpower. For humans (including mages) it's Virtue and Vice, for vampires it's Masque and Dirge, for werewolves it's Blood and Bone, for prometheans it's Elpis and Torment, and for changelings it's Mask and Mien.<br /> It's generally a pair (though some Merits and spells can change this) but that does not mean one Anchor in one pair is the thematic or mechanical equivalent of an Anchor in another pair. Mask does not replace Virtue and Mien does not replace Vice. The Mask/Mien pair replaces the Virtue/Vice pair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T10:20:11-07:00","id":996671,"title":"","content":"ok, I think I get it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T10:21:24-07:00","id":996672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed?p=832853#post832853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll probably consider a name shift.<br /> <br /> Fun fact, here was the original pitch I was going with back before first drafts. This is a direct quote from the email where it was pitched:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">&quot;The </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Needle</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> (What stuck you) and The </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Thread</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> (What Pulled You Loose)? Needles can be anything from corkboard pins, the prick that put Sleeping Beauty to sleep, or the hook in the cheek, thematically. And the </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Thread</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">? Led the hero of the labyrinth. The ties that bind. The red string of fate\u2026or just some unfinished business. How\u2019s THAT for some symbology?&quot;</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I like this Needle and Thread idea, but I'm not sure I totally understand it. Could you elaborate and explain, please?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T12:41:37-07:00","id":996761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed?p=996644#post996644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's generally a pair (though some Merits and spells can change this) but that does not mean one Anchor in one pair is the thematic or mechanical equivalent of an Anchor in another pair.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well.<br /> <br /> One is not a consistent replacement for another, but for the purposes of Social Maneuvering one is generally treated as though it were the Virtue and the other is generally treated as though it were the Vice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T13:22:53-07:00","id":996778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed?p=996644#post996644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anchor is the general system term for a set of traits relating to the Integrity analogue and Willpower. For humans (including mages) it's Virtue and Vice, for vampires it's Masque and Dirge, for werewolves it's Blood and Bone, for prometheans it's Elpis and Torment, and for changelings it's Mask and Mien.<br /> It's generally a pair (though some Merits and spells can change this) but that does not mean one Anchor in one pair is the thematic or mechanical equivalent of an Anchor in another pair. Mask does not replace Virtue and Mien does not replace Vice. The Mask/Mien pair replaces the Virtue/Vice pair.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unless there is an even more final final draft than I saw Changelings now have both Virtue/Vice and Mask/Mien.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/477-xenorath","name":"Xenorath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"169"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T13:48:25-07:00","id":996785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832443-mask-mein-in-2nd-ed?p=832853#post832853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll probably consider a name shift. <br /> <br /> Fun fact, here was the original pitch I was going with back before first drafts. This is a direct quote from the email where it was pitched: <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">&amp;quot;The </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Needle</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> (What stuck you) and The </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Thread</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> (What Pulled You Loose)? Needles can be anything from corkboard pins, the prick that put Sleeping Beauty to sleep, or the hook in the cheek, thematically. And the </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Thread</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#1F497D\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">? Led the hero of the labyrinth. The ties that bind. The red string of fate\u2026or just some unfinished business. How\u2019s THAT for some symbology?&amp;quot;</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div> Dearheart still refers to needle and thread. <br /> <br /> And yeah Character creation still refers to vice &amp; virtue, instead of Mask/Mein anchors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T15:33:24-07:00","id":996845,"title":"","content":"I'm 99.99% certain that any reference to Virtue and Vice will be changed to Mask and Mien. It's probably either a writer using the wrong terms or a copy/paste error from CofD or MtA. And that's why there's an editing process. Sometimes writers just make mistakes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T20:39:06-07:00","id":996980,"title":"","content":"Ok, from what I'm getting, it sounds like The changeling Mask/Mien, Needle/Thread or whatever it ends up being called is about conforming to a role. So how does that work with Grimm, who are all about shifting roles (not counting the ones that just stick to one role)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T16:56:51-07:00","id":997439,"title":"","content":"I like the concept of Truth and Tale, and this made me think on something like Dream and Tale. <br /> <br /> The Tale is about your durance, who were you, what did you do, is your tragedy and your legend. <br /> The Dream is what brought you back home, the deep thruth inside you that allowed you to bypass the thorns, your little big secret, your little big hope, the reason you don't give up.<br /> <br /> For example, my character Isabella (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/841320-2e-changeling-characters?p=978678#post978678\">link here</a>), a Fairiest Metalflesh/Razorhand, was known as the Dark Knight when in service of her lord (a lackey like was Vader to Palpatine). So her &quot;Tale&quot; aspect would be &quot;The Dark Night&quot;, a cruel enforcer that used fear and force to achieve her purposes. She then repented and seeked redemption through a rebellion, and she lost, fleeing to the mortal world, were she seeks to use her strength to redeem herself. So, her &quot;Dream&quot; aspect would be &quot;Redemption&quot;, &quot;Salvation&quot; or some other fitting aspect I still have to think of that describes her ideas right now.<br /> <br /> It's and idea. Hope it helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12340-dourden","name":"dourden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}